# TrustGuard Pricing Page v3 — PROD Deployment Config (Port 8085)
# Author: Product Strategist | Date: 2026-09-12
# Status: Ready for Execution

## 🎯 Deployment Objectives
- Serve tiered pricing ($49/$199/$599) with dynamic ROI calculator
- Enforce zero-trust protocol compliance headers
- Route inbound leads to FRTS v1.0 intake pipeline (≤24h SLA)
- Maintain "Coming Soon" designation for ASPM/AppSOC per Board directive

## ⚙️ Nginx/Cloudflare Config Snippet
```nginx
server {
    listen 8085;
    server_name pricing.ntrust.ai;
    
    # Zero-Trust Security Headers
    add_header X-Frame-Options "DENY" always;
    add_header X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff" always;
    add_header Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains" always;
    add_header Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline';" always;
    
    location /pricing {
        root /var/www/trustguard;
        index pricing_v3.html;
        try_files $uri $uri/ /pricing/index.html;
        
        # Lead capture form routing
        location = /pricing/subscribe {
            proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:55127/api/v1/intake/frts;
            proxy_set_header X-Request-ID $request_id;
        }
    }
    
    # ASPM/AppSOC Coming Soon Gate
    location /appsoc {
        return 302 /pricing/coming-soon.html;
    }
}
```

## 📊 Pricing Tier Rendering Logic (React/Vite)
| Component | State | Action |
|-----------|-------|--------|
| Essentials ($49) | Active | Redirect to `signup?tier=essentials` |
| Professional ($199) | Active | Redirect to `signup?tier=professional` |
| Enterprise ($599) | Active | Trigger SOW request modal → FRTS intake |
| ASPM/AppSOC | Coming Soon | Display locked tier with "Request Early Access" CTA |

